  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through JUST WORLD in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JUST WORLD empowers youth (age 13-30) to actively engage in policy and decision-making from local (Palestine) to international level. The youth will be mobilised in groups and will receive trainings on advocacy, leadership, human rights (focusing on rights of PWDs and women rights) and non-violent tools. The groups will also develop their own initiatives and campaigns, majorly focusing on UNSCR 1325 &amp; 2250 and rights of PWDs.</narrative>
  </description>
